# Mutation plan for the plugin API's user, team, channel, post, permission, bot and websocket
# methods (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 6).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-api-core.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_core_methods_answer_as_go_answers`: 88 API
# calls from inside MessageWillBePosted on a Go host and a Rust host, every answer, every hook the
# script's writes fire on the recorder, every frame the own user's socket receives, and the bot
# rows left behind. One line is a unit mutation (`plugin_api_wire`), because the recorder's id is
# already lower case. The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

